\t\t\t<a href=\"@root/Compartido/Images/Sincronizado/IMG-20221029-WA0003-a072d4717c9d2b.jpg\" aria-label=\"A group photo at IndieDevDay\" data-elementor-lightbox-slideshow=\"fc-about-photos\" data-elementor-lightbox-title=\"A group photo at IndieDevDay\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"225\" src=\"@root/Compartido/Images/Sincronizado/IMG-20221029-WA0003-300x225-9c6426e76d48dd.jpg\" class=\"attachment-medium size-medium wp-image-5189\" alt=\"\">\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-8d9f80c elementor-section-full_width fc-home fc-about-story elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"8d9f80c\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-no\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-33 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-780d2ad\" data-id=\"780d2ad\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-91e8c62 fc-story-heading elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"91e8c62\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Description</h2>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-b433001 fc-about-copy elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"b433001\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p data-pm-slice=\"1 1 []\">We love creating games, and that’s what drives us every day.</p><p>Flynn’s Arcade is an independent game developer and publisher. We create our own games and bring exciting titles from talented indie developers to players around the world.</p><p>We believe great games can be simple, thoughtfully designed, and full of personality. Our goal is to deliver fun, engaging, and memorable gaming experiences.</p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-33 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-3522d62\" data-id=\"3522d62\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-8fbfcac fc-story-heading elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"8fbfcac\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Early history</h2>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6924756 fc-about-copy elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"6924756\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p data-pm-slice=\"1 1 []\">Everything began several years ago at the Autonomous University of Barcelona, where Juan Peralta, CEO of Flynn’s Arcade, was teaching and supervising final-year degree projects related to video game development.</p><p>One of these projects was based on an ambitious idea: to develop a completely different kind of augmented reality (AR) mobile game that would reinvent the concept of traditional board games. This project was called OUTSIDERS.</p><p>OUTSIDERS combined elements of tabletop games like Warhammer with video games like XCOM, bringing them together through augmented reality. During the development of this project, Juan Peralta met Francisco Raya, one of its designers.</p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-33 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-c356a24\" data-id=\"c356a24\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-2a6c85a fc-story-heading elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"2a6c85a\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">What came next</h2>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-0946a6d fc-about-copy elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"0946a6d\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p data-pm-slice=\"1 1 []\">Currently, Juan Peralta holds a PhD in artificial intelligence, serves as a lecturer at the Polytechnic University of Valencia, and works as a researcher at the Institute of Automation and Industrial Informatics. He balances his teaching and research responsibilities with the development of new video game projects and the publishing of games from third-party studios.</p><p>That decision marked the beginning of Flynn’s Arcade and laid the foundation for the projects that followed. Since then, Francisco and Juan have continued working on new projects, with the goal of creating incredible and memorable gaming experiences for players.</p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-60fc7d8 elementor-section-full_width fc-shared-projects fc-about-projects elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"60fc7d8\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-no\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-4a2dc25\" data-id=\"4a2dc25\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-aa064b3 elementor-widget elementor-widget-shortcode\" data-id=\"aa064b3\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"shortcode.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-shortcode\">\t\t<!-- shared:proyectos -->\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-a95950c elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"a95950c\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-585b0cf\" data-id=\"585b0cf\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-184ae07 elementor-widget elementor-widget-shortcode\" data-id=\"184ae07\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"shortcode.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-contai